CURRICULUM CONTENT

This application includes Victorian Curriculum F-10 Version 2.0 content
descriptions, reproduced under the licence VCAA grants for them:

  The Victorian Curriculum F-10 content elements are (c) VCAA, licensed
  CC-BY-NC. The Victorian Curriculum F-10 and related content can be accessed
  directly at the VCAA website (https://f10.vcaa.vic.edu.au).
  Copyright statement: https://f10.vcaa.vic.edu.au/copyright-statement

That content was exported from the VCAA curriculum download tool on
13 September 2026 and reformatted into the application's own data structure.
The content description text itself is unchanged. Achievement standards,
elaborations and cross-curriculum priorities were not included.

VCAA licenses this content for non-commercial use only. It remains (c) VCAA
under its own licence and is not covered by the grant above. Both licences
prohibit commercial use, so the same restriction applies either way: this
application may not be sold or used commercially.

A school outside Victoria can replace the curriculum data with its own.

CONTACT

